WEBVTT

00:47.845 --> 00:51.827
October 86, and the mountain air is cold.

00:54.824 --> 01:01.095
Student contest flyer printed out in bold. They

01:01.175 --> 01:04.316
asked for a brand new anthem to shake the autumn

01:04.396 --> 01:07.577
night. A song to lead the forges out into the

01:07.617 --> 01:10.537
stadium light. We rolled the tape machine into

01:10.617 --> 01:13.818
our basement room. And rode a thunderclap to

01:13.858 --> 01:17.719
make the valley boom. 60,000 standing in the

01:17.739 --> 01:21.020
maroon and orange sea. Waiting for the signal,

01:21.040 --> 01:24.521
let's CPI with me. Feel the concrete tremble

01:24.701 --> 01:27.901
underneath your feet. Hear the loudest house

01:27.961 --> 01:30.402
and college sports repeat.

01:32.424 --> 01:35.386
Under the Saturday night lights Inside the

01:35.426 --> 01:38.749
crucible Where the sound of the engine makes us

01:38.889 --> 01:42.292
invincible Hear the forges call Echoing across

01:42.332 --> 01:46.456
the sky Raise the maroon and orange banners high

01:46.796 --> 01:50.359
When the tunnel opens up and the speakers roar

01:50.459 --> 01:55.203
We're not just a basement band anymore

02:02.208 --> 02:05.351
Tyler on the drums like a marching thunder line.

02:05.852 --> 02:09.735
Evan on the bass keeping clockwork time. Analog

02:09.775 --> 02:12.878
synths rising like a rocket on the pad. Pouring

02:13.018 --> 02:16.262
out every ounce of fire that we had. From the

02:16.322 --> 02:20.305
press box roof down to the 50 yard line. 60,000

02:20.366 --> 02:24.229
voices singing every single line. 60,000

02:24.249 --> 02:27.331
standing in the maroon and orange sea Waiting

02:27.391 --> 02:30.373
for the signal, it's CPI with me Feel the

02:30.433 --> 02:34.015
concrete tremble underneath your feet Hear the

02:34.235 --> 02:36.957
loudest house and college sports repeat

02:39.569 --> 02:42.451
under the saturday night lights inside the

02:42.511 --> 02:45.833
crucible where the sound of the engine makes us

02:45.933 --> 02:48.675
invincible hear the forger's call echoing

02:48.775 --> 02:52.377
across the sky raise the maroon and orange

02:52.457 --> 02:55.859
banners high when the tunnel opens up and the

02:55.879 --> 03:01.182
speakers roar we're not just a basement band

03:01.543 --> 03:02.243
anymore

03:23.448 --> 03:28.292
Go Forgers! Hear the valley sing! Go CPI! Let the

03:28.413 --> 03:32.356
iron bell ring! That was the night our destiny

03:32.396 --> 03:36.480
was cast! A Saturday night memory built to last!

